{'symbol': 'MKTX', 'date': '2022-11-28 16:15:00', 'title': 'MARKETAXESS TO PARTICIPATE IN THE GOLDMAN SACHS U.S. FINANCIAL SERVICES CONFERENCE', 'text': 'NEW YORK--( BUSINESS WIRE )--MARKETAXESS HOLDINGS INC. (NASDAQ: MKTX), THE OPERATOR OF A LEADING ELECTRONIC TRADING PLATFORM FOR FIXED-INCOME SECURITIES, AND THE PROVIDER OF MARKET DATA AND POST-TRADE SERVICES FOR THE GLOBAL FIXED-INCOME MARKETS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT RICK MCVEY, CHAIRMAN AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, WILL PARTICIPATE IN A FIRESIDE CHAT AT 2:20 P.M. ET AT THE GOLDMAN SACHS U.S. FINANCIAL SERVICES CONFERENCE ON DECEMBER 6, 2022.'}